title: Shadow Investigation
subtitle: Dig into the hidden currents behind the Republic's crises.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_shadow.svg
view-if: investigate_timer <= 0 and date >= 12 and cardok_investigate
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; investigate_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "investigate"; investigated_at = time
new-page: true

= Shadow Investigation

[? if sith_stage = 0 : Too many of the Republic's crises seem to serve someone. ?][? if sith_stage = 1 : The Jedi say a Sith Lord has returned. If he has, the Republic's crises may be his work, and someone, somewhere, is serving him. ?][? if sith_stage = 2 : One hidden hand is behind the Republic's crises: the same money, the same timing, the same people profiting. It belongs to a Sith Lord[? if gunray_testified or gunray_convicted : the Trade Federation knew as Darth Sidious ?]. ?][? if sith_stage = 3 : The trail leads to Coruscant, and close to power. The Caucus has a shortlist: [+ suspects_open_text +]. ?][? if sith_stage = 4 : Every other door has closed. The Sith Lord is [+ pal_title +]. Knowing it is not proving it. ?] Our proof is **[+ evidence : evidence +]**. Investigations carry risks: the people behind these events do not like being looked at.

[? if investigators_lost > 0 : We have already lost [+ investigators_lost +] investigator(s). ?]

- @look_amedda: Look into Mas Amedda.
- @look_pestage: Look into Sate Pestage.
- @look_free_taa: Look into Orn Free Taa.
- @look_dod: Look into Lott Dod.
- @money: Follow the money.
- @slicer: Hire a slicer to break into sealed records.
- @share: Share our findings with the Jedi Council.
- @archives: Pursue the gap in the Jedi Archives.
- @brief: Brief trusted senators and justices in confidence.
- @charges: Lay charges before the Senate.
- @records: Comb through public records.
- @easy_discard

@look_amedda
view-if: sith_stage = 3 and not suspect_amedda
subtitle: −1 political capital. The Vice Chair controls the Senate's agenda, and nobody knows who controls him.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.clearSuspect(Q, 'amedda', 'look'); !}
go-to: look_result

@look_pestage
view-if: sith_stage = 3 and not suspect_pestage
subtitle: −1 political capital. Half the Senate's appointments pass through his hands.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.clearSuspect(Q, 'pestage', 'look'); !}
go-to: look_result

@look_free_taa
view-if: sith_stage = 3 and not suspect_free_taa
subtitle: −1 political capital. Rich, unscrupulous, and everywhere the money is.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.clearSuspect(Q, 'free_taa', 'look'); !}
go-to: look_result

@look_dod
view-if: sith_stage = 3 and not suspect_dod
subtitle: −1 political capital. The Trade Federation's man, and the Damask money ran through the Federation.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.clearSuspect(Q, 'dod', 'look'); !}
go-to: look_result

@look_result

Weeks of quiet work on [+ suspect_last_name +]. [+ suspect_last_finding +] Whatever [+ suspect_last_name +] is, it is not the Sith Lord. [? if suspects_open > 0 : The shortlist is shorter. ?][? if suspects_open = 0 : The shortlist is empty, and the Caucus is left looking at the one man nobody thought to suspect. ?]

@money
subtitle: −1 political capital. Slow but fairly safe.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var gain = 0.35 + (Q.tf_probe ? 0.15 : 0) + (Q.chair_finance === 'rc' ? 0.25 : 0) + (Q.banking_audit ? 0.2 : 0);
Q.evidence += gain;
Q.inv_result = 'The trail leads through shell companies, a Muunilinst bank and a dead Muun financier\'s holding company, Damask Holdings.';
if (Math.random() < 0.08 + Q.grand_plan / 600) { Q.leak_pending = 1; Q.inv_result += ' Someone noticed us looking.'; }
!}

[+ inv_result +]

@slicer
subtitle: −2 political capital. Faster, but riskier.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 2;
Q.evidence += 0.8 + (Q.chair_judiciary === 'rc' ? 0.3 : 0);
var target = Q.sith_named ? (Q.chancellor_bloc === 'pal' ? 'Chancellery correspondence' : 'correspondence from Senator Palpatine\'s office') :
  (Q.sith_stage >= 3 ? 'sealed records from the Senate\'s inner circle' : 'sealed records from the companies that profited from the crises');
Q.inv_result = 'Our slicer cracks an archive of ' + target + '. Most of it is dull. A little of it is chilling.';
if (Math.random() < 0.2 + Q.grand_plan / 400) { Q.leak_pending = 1; Q.inv_result += ' Then the slicer stops answering her comlink.'; }
!}

[+ inv_result +]

@share
view-if: evidence >= 2
subtitle: The Jedi grow more suspicious, and closer to us.
on-arrival: jedi_suspicion += 1; jedi_relation += 2; evidence += 0.2

Master Windu reads our dossier in silence. "This is not proof," he says at last. "But it is not nothing."

@archives
view-if: archive_gap_known and not kamino_known
subtitle: −1 political capital. Someone erased a star system from the Archives.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; kamino_hunt += 1; evidence += 0.3

Our people work through old hyperspace charts, cargo manifests and the travel logs of a dead Jedi Master named Sifo-Dyas. [? if kamino_hunt >= 2 : The gap is closing. One more push and we will find the missing world. ?]

@brief
view-if: evidence >= 6 and not case_briefed and not sidious_known and not finale
subtitle: −1 political capital. When the case is ready, it will have friends waiting in the Senate and the courts.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; case_briefed = 1; senate_resolve += 0.3

Bail Organa invites a handful of senators and two Supreme Court justices to a quiet dinner and shows them part of the file. Nobody says anything aloud. Everybody understands.

@charges
view-if: sith_named and evidence >= 7 and not sidious_known and not finale
subtitle: [? if dooku_turned or evidence >= 10 : Our case is conclusive. This is the moment. ?][? if not dooku_turned and evidence >= 9 and evidence < 10 : Our case is strong. It will probably hold, but not certainly. ?][? if not dooku_turned and evidence < 9 : Our case is not yet strong enough; it will probably fail, and if it fails, the Caucus may not survive. ?]
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 2; !}
go-to: fin_charges

@records
subtitle: Free. Slow, safe work.
on-arrival: evidence += 0.15

Caucus researchers read shipping registries and committee minutes until their eyes ache. Now and then something does not add up.
